> [    0.321392][    T1] kvm [1]: nVHE hyp BUG at: [<ffffffc08112ee8c>] __kvm_nvhe_$x.24+0x254/0x254!
> [    0.321522][    T1] kvm [1]: Cannot dump pKVM nVHE stacktrace: !CONFIG_PROTECTED_NVHE_STACKTRACE
